---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Terms & Conditions', href: '/terms-conditions/' }];
---
<Base title="Terms & Conditions" description="The terms and conditions governing use of the Senior and Living Today website, including content use, disclaimers and your responsibilities." breadcrumbs={crumbs}>
  <PageHero title="Terms & Conditions" breadcrumbs={crumbs} lead="Effective date: April 1, 2025" />
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
    <p>By using our website, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
    <h2>2. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may revise these Terms at any time. Continuing to use the site after changes means you accept them.</p>
    <h2>3. Use of site and content</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You may use the site for personal, non-commercial purposes only.</li>
      <li>All content, including text, images and design, is owned by us or our licensors. Unauthorized copying, modification or distribution is prohibited.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>4. User conduct</h2>
    <p>You agree not to engage in unlawful, harmful or malicious activity (such as hacking or data scraping), or use the site in any way that disrupts or overburdens it.</p>
    <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Our brand, name and content are protected. You may not use them without written permission.</p>
    <h2>6. Not professional advice</h2>
    <p>Information on this site and in our consultations is general guidance and support. It is not medical, legal or financial advice. Always consult a licensed professional about your specific situation.</p>
    <h2>7. Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The site and its content are provided "as is" without warranty. We make no express or implied guarantees about accuracy or availability.</li>
      <li>We are not liable for damages arising from your use of the site, except where prohibited by law.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>
    <p>You agree to indemnify and hold us harmless from claims or losses arising from your breach of these Terms.</p>
    <h2>9. External links</h2>
    <p>Links to third-party sites are provided for convenience. We are not responsible for their content or practices.</p>
    <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Ohio, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules. Any dispute will be resolved in the state or federal courts located in Montgomery County, Ohio.</p>
    <h2>11. Time to file claims</h2>
    <p>Any claim related to the site must be filed within one (1) year after the claim arises, to the extent permitted by law.</p>
    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a><br />Mail: {SITE.name}, {SITE.address.street}, {SITE.address.city}, {SITE.address.region} {SITE.address.postalCode}</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
